  message: "Materialized from dogfood tranche 05 (F100.A1 / anon-card-010). Mechanism: node.id NAME slot (spec §317 {name} segment) carries a linker-category constant or route method+path while node.name carries the specific value. Evidence: frozen substrate.json (probe_2_name2.log/probe_2_name3.log) — 255 non-file id-name mismatches (130 call_site + 124 function + 1 method); fresh run on /tmp/hg_nameslot/runner.py reproduces (subprocess_call id-slot vs node.name 'git config'/'ls'). Magnitude: 255 synthetic nodes; an indexer keyed on parsed-id-name collapses 78 subprocess call_sites under one label. Blind severity 3/5, reproduced on frozen substrate + fresh run (deterministic producer). RELATED_BUT_DISTINCT from F84.A1/its sibling (id KIND-segment vs node.kind), INV-dulah (id format escaping / file nodes — distinct slot and mechanism), parent META INV-kurup (identifier-bearing fields emit non-canonical formats), and WI-nagam (language=None). This is the id NAME-slot vs node.name disagreement specifically."  # 3cb1
